    revealEn: 'Questionnaire / multi-item scale. The inspectable instrument includes a construct definition, item set, response scale, subscales and evidence from development and validation checks.',
    revealZh: '問卷／多題量表。可檢視的工具包括構念界定、題項組、作答量尺、分量表，以及發展和驗證檢查的證據。',
    noteEn: 'FLTSS paper: what the authors report about the instrument',
    noteZh: 'FLTSS 論文：作者如何介紹工具',
    pdf: withBase('/papers/dedc02/data-collection/sadoughi-hejazi-2022-fltss.pdf'),
