    source: 'Frontiers in Education, 6:732373 · Methods p. 4',
    descriptionEn: 'Two semi-structured protocols were used at two time points: one elicited conceptions; the other elicited concrete practice examples. Four graduate students piloted the questions through think-alouds; interviews were audio-recorded and transcribed.',
    descriptionZh: '研究在兩個時間點使用兩份半結構式指南：一份引出觀念，另一份引出具體實踐例子。四名研究生以有聲思考試答問題；訪談經錄音及逐字轉錄。',
