    title: 'Implementing a formative assessment model at the secondary schools: attitudes and challenges',
    source: 'Language Testing in Asia, 11:18 · Methods pp. 6–7',
    descriptionEn: 'The study ran 12 focus groups, one in each school, with nine Grade 8 students selected to include different achievement levels. The protocol addressed understanding, attitudes, criteria, roles, barriers and recommendations; discussions were held in Bangla, transcribed and translated.',
