    title: 'Exploring shared and individual assessment of paired oral interactions',
    source: 'Studies in Language Assessment · Methods pp. 6–9',
    descriptionEn: 'Six ten-minute paired interactions were sampled and presented as audio or video. Sixty trained raters used an analytic rubric covering discourse management, collaborative communication, content development, and language accuracy and complexity.',
