    noteZh: 'Rahman 等人論文：作者如何介紹文件證據',
    pdf: withBase('/papers/dedc02/data-collection/rahman-et-al-2021-sba.pdf'),
    record: 'https://doi.org/10.1186/s40468-021-00136-3',
    licence: 'CC BY 4.0',
  },
  {
    id: 'poole-traces', answer: 'digital', marker: 'G',
    citation: 'Poole, Coss & Clarke-Midura (2025)',
    title: 'Developing stealth assessments to assess young Chinese learners’ L2 reading comprehension',
    source: 'Language Learning & Technology, 29(2) · Methods pp. 7–10',
    descriptionEn: 'Game log files stored movements and choices with timestamps in JSON after each session. The specification identified indicators such as reading time, prompted response, sentence length, glossary use, prior vocabulary knowledge, repeated exposure and comprehension outcomes.',
    descriptionZh: '遊戲記錄檔在每節結束後以 JSON 儲存移動、選擇及時間戳。規格界定閱讀時間、是否需要作答、句子長度、詞彙表使用、既有詞彙知識、重複接觸及理解結果等指標。',
    revealEn: 'Digital trace specification. Report which events are logged, timestamps and identifiers, platform and file format, variable definitions, collection window, exclusions, cleaning, linkage, consent and privacy.',
