    source: 'Frontiers in Psychology, 13:930075 · Methods pp. 4–6',
    descriptionEn: 'During listening tests, the study combined a metacognitive questionnaire with gaze measures from a Tobii eye tracker and brain-activation measures from a customised fNIRS headcap. The protocol aligned devices, test phases and derived measures.',
    descriptionZh: '研究在聆聽測驗中結合後設認知問卷、Tobii 眼動儀的凝視指標，以及訂製 fNIRS 頭套的腦部活動指標；程序把裝置、測驗階段及衍生測量對齊。',
    revealEn: 'Sensor and physiological protocol. Specify device and placement, calibration, sampling and synchronisation, task phases, derived measures, artefact and exclusion rules, participant burden, safety and data governance.',
